{"title":"C SEED","description":"","products":[{"product_id":"c-seed-Datum Dahleez-n1","title":"C SEED Datum Dahleez N1","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color\" id=\"model-response-message-contentr_d537eb3ff97bac2e\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-busy=\"false\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-path-to-node=\"0\"\u003eC SEED Datum Dahleez N1: The Art of Invisible Luxury\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-path-to-node=\"1\"\u003eA permanently visible television doesn’t just occupy a wall—it dominates the architecture. The \u003cb data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"95\"\u003eC SEED Datum Dahleez N1\u003c\/b\u003e was conceived to restore your room’s autonomy. It is not technology on permanent display, but a transforming kinetic sculpture that yields to the rhythm of your space, appearing only when invited.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-path-to-node=\"3\"\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-path-to-node=\"4\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\"\u003e\u003cb data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"\u003eFrom Sculpture to Cinema\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\"\u003eWhen inactive, the N1 rests as a minimalist, sculptural masterpiece seamlessly integrated into your interior aesthetic. When activated, it transforms into an immersive cinematic centerpiece, preserving the calm, clean lines of contemporary design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\"\u003e\u003cb data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"\u003eThe 45-Second Metamorphosis\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\"\u003eWith a silent, choreographed movement, the N1 unfolds from a sleek statement piece into a giant screen in just 45 seconds. Precision-engineered \u003cb data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"172\"\u003eMicroLED panels\u003c\/b\u003e align seamlessly to deliver extraordinary visual clarity, vibrant colors, and deep contrasts.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\"\u003e\u003cb data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"\u003eTotal Architectural Freedom\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-path-to-node=\"4,2,0\"\u003eFree from the constraints of traditional wall mounting or heavy structural integration, the N1 stands independently like a piece of luxury furniture. Whether placed in front of floor-to-ceiling glass, fine artwork, or open-concept architecture, it enhances its surroundings without ever blocking the view.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp data-path-to-node=\"4,3,0\"\u003e\u003cb data-path-to-node=\"4,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"\u003edatum dahleez-Level Engineering\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-path-to-node=\"4,3,0\"\u003eInspired by the uncompromising craftsmanship and technical sophistication of hypercar design, the N1 features a premium, machined aluminum body. Every mechanical joint and unfolding movement is a testament to high-performance automotive precision—timeless, durable, and effortlessly elegant.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cblockquote data-path-to-node=\"6\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-path-to-node=\"6,0\"\u003e\u003cb data-path-to-node=\"6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"\u003eThe Philosophy:\u003c\/b\u003e True luxury lies in the luxury of choice—the freedom to enjoy world-class cinema, and the stillness of a room when the screen disappears.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/blockquote\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez STORE","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":53224773026139,"sku":null,"price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/CSEEDdatum dahleezN1TV_2.jpg?v=1780345143"}],"url":"https:\/\/Datum Dahleez.store\/collections\/c-seed.oembed","provider":"Datum Dahleez STORE","version":"1.0","type":"link"}